<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1080" height="588" viewBox="0 0 1080 588" role="img" aria-labelledby="title"><title id="title">Why HTTP 200 Availability Still Misses Model Degradation</title><rect width="1080" height="588" fill="#f6f6f3"/><text x="36" y="48" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="600" fill="#697386" text-anchor="start" letter-spacing="0.08em">FIG 01 · DELIVERY TELEMETRY GAP</text><text x="36" y="86" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="27" font-weight="600" fill="#171717" text-anchor="start">Why HTTP 200 Availability Still Misses Model Degradation</text><text x="36" y="118" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#425466" text-anchor="start">Surface ping checks verify network reachability, leaving relay weight swaps and budget cuts unseen.</text><rect x="36" y="144" width="1008" height="72" rx="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#dae1e9" stroke-width="1.2"/><circle cx="62" cy="180" r="6" fill="#159570"/><circle cx="62" cy="180" r="10" fill="none" stroke="#159570" stroke-opacity="0.28" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="84" y="185" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="600" fill="#171717" text-anchor="start">What Standard Monitors Observe (All Green)</text><rect x="574" y="162" width="140" height="36" rx="8" fill="#e9f7f2" stroke="#b7e4d5" stroke-width="1"/><text x="644.0" y="185" font-family="ui-monospace, &#x27;SFMono-Regular&#x27;, Menlo, &#x27;DejaVu Sans Mono&#x27;, monospace" font-size="13" font-weight="600" fill="#146c50" text-anchor="middle">HTTP 200 OK</text><rect x="732" y="162" width="140" height="36" rx="8" fill="#e9f7f2" stroke="#b7e4d5" stroke-width="1"/><text x="802.0" y="185" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="600" fill="#146c50" text-anchor="middle">Fast TTFT</text><rect x="890" y="162" width="140" height="36" rx="8" fill="#e9f7f2" stroke="#b7e4d5" stroke-width="1"/><text x="960.0" y="185" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="600" fill="#146c50" text-anchor="middle">Fluent Text</text><path d="M540 216v18M196 234h688M196 234v22M540 234v22M884 234v22" stroke="#b9c2cc" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="4 3" fill="none"/><rect x="36" y="256" width="320" height="296" rx="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#dae1e9" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="56" y="274" width="190" height="24" rx="6" fill="#fdf4e4" stroke="#ebd4a7"/><text x="66" y="290" font-family="ui-monospace, &#x27;SFMono-Regular&#x27;, Menlo, &#x27;DejaVu Sans Mono&#x27;, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#925e12" text-anchor="start">MODE 01 · ROUTING DRIFT</text><rect x="56" y="310" width="280" height="114" rx="8" fill="#f7f9fc" stroke="#e3e8ee"/><rect x="68" y="347" width="84" height="38" rx="6" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#533AFD" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="110" y="370" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#432dd7" text-anchor="middle">Flagship req</text><path d="M152 366h24" stroke="#425466" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="184" cy="366" r="10" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#425466" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M180 366h8m-4-4v8" stroke="#425466" stroke-width="1.3"/><path d="M193 360 C208 342, 214 340, 226 340" stroke="#c5cfdb" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="3 3" fill="none"/><rect x="228" y="324" width="96" height="32" rx="6" fill="#f1f4f8" stroke="#c5cfdb" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/><text x="276" y="344" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="500" fill="#87909f" text-anchor="middle">Original weights</text><path d="M193 372 C208 390, 214 392, 226 392" stroke="#B7791F" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none"/><path d="M221 388l6 4-6 4" stroke="#B7791F" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/><rect x="228" y="374" width="96" height="34" rx="6" fill="#fdf4e4" stroke="#B7791F" stroke-width="1.4"/><text x="276" y="395" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#925e12" text-anchor="middle">Compact / old</text><text x="56" y="454" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="600" fill="#171717" text-anchor="start">Silent Model Substitution</text><text x="56" y="482" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#425466" text-anchor="start">Peak-hour or long-context calls</text><text x="56" y="504" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#425466" text-anchor="start">get routed silently to cheaper</text><text x="56" y="526" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#425466" text-anchor="start">lightweight or older snapshots.</text><rect x="380" y="256" width="320" height="296" rx="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#dae1e9" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="400" y="274" width="190" height="24" rx="6" fill="#fdf4e4" stroke="#ebd4a7"/><text x="410" y="290" font-family="ui-monospace, &#x27;SFMono-Regular&#x27;, Menlo, &#x27;DejaVu Sans Mono&#x27;, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#925e12" text-anchor="start">MODE 02 · REASONING CUT</text><rect x="400" y="310" width="280" height="114" rx="8" fill="#f7f9fc" stroke="#e3e8ee"/><text x="414" y="338" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#146c50" text-anchor="start">Expected trace</text><rect x="522" y="326" width="20" height="15" rx="3" fill="#b7e4d5" stroke="#159570" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="546" y="326" width="20" height="15" rx="3" fill="#b7e4d5" stroke="#159570" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="570" y="326" width="20" height="15" rx="3" fill="#b7e4d5" stroke="#159570" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="594" y="326" width="20" height="15" rx="3" fill="#b7e4d5" stroke="#159570" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="618" y="326" width="20" height="15" rx="3" fill="#b7e4d5" stroke="#159570" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="642" y="326" width="20" height="15" rx="3" fill="#b7e4d5" stroke="#159570" stroke-width="1"/><text x="414" y="376" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#925e12" text-anchor="start">Capped trace</text><rect x="522" y="364" width="20" height="15" rx="3" fill="#ebd4a7" stroke="#B7791F" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="546" y="364" width="20" height="15" rx="3" fill="#ebd4a7" stroke="#B7791F" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="570" y="364" width="20" height="15" rx="3" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#c5cfdb" stroke-dasharray="2 2"/><rect x="594" y="364" width="20" height="15" rx="3" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#c5cfdb" stroke-dasharray="2 2"/><rect x="618" y="364" width="20" height="15" rx="3" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#c5cfdb" stroke-dasharray="2 2"/><rect x="642" y="364" width="20" height="15" rx="3" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#c5cfdb" stroke-dasharray="2 2"/><line x1="568" y1="354" x2="568" y2="394" stroke="#C9372C" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="3 2"/><rect x="522" y="395" width="140" height="20" rx="5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#dae1e9"/><text x="592" y="409" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="500" fill="#697386" text-anchor="middle">Early reply</text><text x="400" y="454" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="600" fill="#171717" text-anchor="start">Reduced Reasoning Budget</text><text x="400" y="482" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#425466" text-anchor="start">Model family stays listed, while</text><text x="400" y="504" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#425466" text-anchor="start">reasoning effort is trimmed so</text><text x="400" y="526" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#425466" text-anchor="start">the endpoint replies prematurely.</text><rect x="724" y="256" width="320" height="296" rx="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#dae1e9" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="744" y="274" width="190" height="24" rx="6" fill="#fbeceb" stroke="#efc5c2"/><text x="754" y="290" font-family="ui-monospace, &#x27;SFMono-Regular&#x27;, Menlo, &#x27;DejaVu Sans Mono&#x27;, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#a3281e" text-anchor="start">MODE 03 · WINDOW CLIP</text><rect x="744" y="310" width="280" height="114" rx="8" fill="#f7f9fc" stroke="#e3e8ee"/><text x="756" y="334" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="500" fill="#a3281e" text-anchor="start">Dropped turns</text><text x="1012" y="334" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#425466" text-anchor="end">Kept context</text><rect x="756" y="342" width="44" height="24" rx="4" fill="#f1f4f8" stroke="#c5cfdb" stroke-dasharray="3 2"/><line x1="762" y1="362" x2="794" y2="346" stroke="#C9372C" stroke-width="1.3"/><rect x="808" y="342" width="44" height="24" rx="4" fill="#f1f4f8" stroke="#c5cfdb" stroke-dasharray="3 2"/><line x1="814" y1="362" x2="846" y2="346" stroke="#C9372C" stroke-width="1.3"/><rect x="860" y="342" width="44" height="24" rx="4" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#425466" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="869" y1="351" x2="895" y2="351" stroke="#425466" stroke-width="1.4"/><line x1="869" y1="358" x2="889" y2="358" stroke="#87909f" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="912" y="342" width="44" height="24" rx="4" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#425466" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="921" y1="351" x2="947" y2="351" stroke="#425466" stroke-width="1.4"/><line x1="921" y1="358" x2="941" y2="358" stroke="#87909f" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="964" y="342" width="44" height="24" rx="4" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#425466" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="973" y1="351" x2="999" y2="351" stroke="#425466" stroke-width="1.4"/><line x1="973" y1="358" x2="993" y2="358" stroke="#87909f" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="756" y="384" width="136" height="24" rx="5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#425466" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="894" y="384" width="116" height="24" rx="5" fill="#f1f4f8" stroke="#c5cfdb" stroke-dasharray="3 2"/><line x1="893" y1="376" x2="893" y2="414" stroke="#C9372C" stroke-width="1.8"/><text x="952" y="400" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#a3281e" text-anchor="middle">Output limit</text><text x="744" y="454" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="600" fill="#171717" text-anchor="start">Context &amp; Output Truncation</text><text x="744" y="482" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#425466" text-anchor="start">Early conversation context is</text><text x="744" y="504" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#425466" text-anchor="start">dropped or output capped, causing</text><text x="744" y="526" font-family="Inter, Roboto, &#x27;DejaVu Sans&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#425466" text-anchor="start">missed constraints in long runs.</text></svg>
